{
    "appliance_id": "f5f55dbb-0afb-4e9f-aa91-17145450679e",
    "name": "OpenLDAP",
    "category": "guest",
    "description": "OpenLDAP is a free, open source implementation of the Lightweight Directory Access Protocol (LDAP) developed by the OpenLDAP Project. This appliance runs the slapd server in a Docker container (osixia/openldap image) and can be used for labs involving centralized authentication, directory lookups or AAA testing.",
    "vendor_name": "OpenLDAP Foundation",
    "vendor_url": "https://www.openldap.org/",
    "documentation_url": "https://github.com/osixia/container-openldap",
    "product_name": "OpenLDAP",
    "product_url": "https://github.com/osixia/container-openldap",
    "registry_version": 8,
    "status": "stable",
    "maintainer": "YueGuobin",
    "maintainer_email": "yueguobin@outlook.com",
    "usage": "Default directory: dc=example,dc=org. Admin DN: cn=admin,dc=example,dc=org with password admin.\n\nThe console opens a shell inside the container with ldap-utils installed, e.g.:\n\nldapsearch -x -b dc=example,dc=org -D \"cn=admin,dc=example,dc=org\" -w admin\n\nTo change the organisation, domain or passwords, edit the template's environment before starting the node for the first time (bootstrap only happens once): LDAP_ORGANISATION, LDAP_DOMAIN, LDAP_ADMIN_PASSWORD, LDAP_CONFIG_PASSWORD.\n\nTLS is enabled by default with an auto-generated certificate, so ldaps://:636 and STARTTLS are available. For a plaintext-only lab setup, set LDAP_TLS=false in the template environment before the first start. TLS settings are applied at bootstrap and cannot be changed afterwards without recreating the node.\n\nThe LDAP database (/var/lib/ldap) and configuration (/etc/ldap/slapd.d) are persisted as Docker volumes per project. Delete and re-add the node to start from an empty directory.\n\nContainer logs are available with 'docker logs <container>' on the GNS3 server host.",
    "symbol": ":/symbols/affinity/circle/blue/ldap.svg",
    "settings": [
        {
            "name": "Default template settings",
            "default": true,
            "template_type": "docker",
            "template_properties": {
                "adapters": 1,
                "image": "osixia/openldap:1.5.0",
                "console_type": "docker_exec",
                "environment": "LDAP_ORGANISATION=Example Inc.\nLDAP_DOMAIN=example.org\nLDAP_ADMIN_PASSWORD=admin\nLDAP_CONFIG_PASSWORD=config",
                "extra_volumes": [
                    "/var/lib/ldap",
                    "/etc/ldap/slapd.d"
                ]
            }
        }
    ]
}
